#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification.field_spms_invoice_verification_error__amount_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification.field_spms_invoice_verification_line__amount_difference
msgid ""
"Billed minus allowed, untaxed: positive for an over-billed claim, negative "
"when the verification allowed more than billed. This is the base the credit-"
"note line will carry, sign included; VAT is applied by the line's taxes."
msgstr ""
"Facturat menys admès, sense impostos: positiu per a una prestació facturada "
"de més, negatiu quan la verificació ha admès més del facturat. És la base "
"que portarà la línia de la nota de crèdit, signe inclòs; l'IVA l'apliquen "
"els impostos de la línia."

