"Claim total as read by the verification, untaxed (ValorTotalLido); read from"
" the document, never recomputed."
msgstr ""
"Total de la prestació llegit per la verificació, sense impostos "
"(ValorTotalLido); llegit del document, mai recalculat."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification.field_spms_invoice_verification_error__amount_allowed
