#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification.field_spms_invoice_verification__amount_lines_negative_untaxed
msgid ""
"Sum of the negative differences, without taxes: the claims the verification "
"allowed above the billed amount. Each one becomes a negative line of the "
"credit note (a positive line of the debit note), netting against the over-"
"billed claims exactly as the official value does."
msgstr ""
"Suma de les diferències negatives, sense impostos: les prestacions que la "
"verificació ha admès per sobre de l'import facturat. Cadascuna es converteix"
" en una línia negativa de la nota de crèdit (una línia positiva de la nota "
"de dèbit), que compensa les prestacions facturades de més exactament com fa "
"el valor oficial."

