#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification.spms_invoice_verification_view_form
msgid "Tax Included"
msgstr "Amb impostos"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/spms_invoice_verification.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(kind)s cannot be generated: its total %(draft)s differs from the official value %(official)s by %(difference)s, and the SPMS adjustment limit of company %(company)s allows at most %(limit)s.\n"
"\n"
"Only the rounding cent of the tax may be written on the tax line of the %(kind)s. A larger difference reveals a discrepancy to review before retrying: the Claims Credit of the result must match its official totals before tax (a prescription the verification priced differently from the invoice makes them diverge), and the company must round its taxes globally (Accounting > Settings > Taxes > Rounding Method), as the CCF computes the tax once on the invoice total. Raise the SPMS adjustment limit of the company only when the difference is legitimate and strictly necessary."
msgstr ""
"No es pot generar la %(kind)s: el seu total %(draft)s difereix del valor oficial %(official)s en %(difference)s, i el límit d'ajust SPMS de l'empresa %(company)s permet com a màxim %(limit)s.\n"
"\n"
"A la línia d'impost de la %(kind)s només s'hi pot escriure el cèntim d'arrodoniment de l'impost. Una diferència més gran revela una discrepància a revisar abans de tornar-ho a provar: el Crèdit de prestacions del resultat ha de coincidir amb els seus totals oficials sense impostos (una recepta que la verificació ha valorat amb un preu diferent del de la factura els fa divergir), i l'empresa ha d'arrodonir els impostos globalment (Comptabilitat > Configuració > Impostos > Mètode d'arrodoniment), perquè el CCF calcula l'impost una sola vegada sobre el total de la factura. Augmenteu el límit d'ajust SPMS de l'empresa només quan la diferència sigui legítima i resulti estrictament necessari."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/spms_invoice_verification.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The %(kind)s total %(total).2f still differs from the official value "
"%(official).2f after imposing the tax amount."
msgstr ""
"El total de la %(kind)s %(total).2f continua diferint del valor oficial "
"%(official).2f després d'imposar l'import de l'impost."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The CCF answered with a server error (%(status)s) and no usable content. The"
" problem is at SPMS, not in this invoice or its data: try again in a few "
"minutes. Technical detail: %(detail)s."
msgstr ""
"El CCF ha respost amb un error de servidor (%(status)s) i sense contingut "
"útil. El problema és de l'SPMS, no d'aquesta factura ni de les seves dades: "
"torneu-ho a provar d'aquí a uns minuts. Detall tècnic: %(detail)s."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The CCF answered with an unexpected return code: %s."
msgstr "El CCF ha respost amb un codi de retorn inesperat: %s."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The CCF answered without a verification document or a return code."
msgstr "El CCF ha respost sense document de verificació ni codi de retorn."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The CCF did not answer within %(seconds)s seconds. The problem is at SPMS, "
"not in this invoice or its data: try again in a few minutes. Technical "
"detail: %(detail)s"
msgstr ""
"El CCF no ha respost en %(seconds)s segons. El problema és de l'SPMS, no "
"d'aquesta factura ni de les seves dades: torneu-ho a provar d'aquí a uns "
"minuts. Detall tècnic: %(detail)s"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The CCF does not recognise invoice %(invoice)s even though it was sent "
"successfully (%(code)s)."
msgstr ""
"El CCF no reconeix la factura %(invoice)s tot i que es va enviar "
"correctament (%(code)s)."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The CCF returned an answer that could not be interpreted (%(status)s). "
"Technical detail: %(detail)s."
msgstr ""
"El CCF ha retornat una resposta que no s'ha pogut interpretar (%(status)s). "
"Detall tècnic: %(detail)s."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The CCF web service could not be reached (connection problem). The problem "
"is at SPMS or in the network, not in this invoice: try again in a few "
"minutes. Technical detail: %(detail)s"
msgstr ""
"No s'ha pogut contactar amb el servei web del CCF (problema de connexió). El"
" problema és de l'SPMS o de la xarxa, no d'aquesta factura: torneu-ho a "
"provar d'aquí a uns minuts. Detall tècnic: %(detail)s"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_verification/models/edi_exchange_record.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The CCF web service is unavailable (%s)."
msgstr "El servei web del CCF no està disponible (%s)."

